∇ WriteExpected files;f;t
 ⍝ Write the expected .json and .events for fixtures ('' = all) from the reference
 ⍝ model. Never from uwsch/ical: that would make their bugs the expected output.
 ⍝ Review the diff: these files are the specification the code is tested against.
  :If 0=≢files ⋄ files←Fixtures ⋄ :EndIf
  :For f :In ⊆files
      t←ReadRaw f
      (RefDump t)WriteRaw(¯4↓f),'.json'
      (Lines RefEvents t)WriteRaw(¯4↓f),'.events'
  :EndFor
  Say'Wrote expected files for ',(⍕≢⊆files),' fixture(s). Review with: git diff tests/fixtures'
∇
